  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">Given a transient/uploaded doc, when Restore from Source is invoked, then content is restored without blanking or re-upload.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Negative: the transient/draft mount behaviors from 010/011 are not regressed.</criterion>
